  "zh": "# APEC深圳峰会与AI新模型成焦点，地缘、科技、商业、安全多线并进\n## 国际政治\n- **习近平会见普京**：中俄领导人于APEC期间会晤，释放深化战略协作信号，影响亚太地缘格局。\n- **美国机密通信网络瘫痪**：高度机密的国家安全通信系统中断，暴露关键基础设施脆弱性。\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI发布GPT-6.2**：新一代模型Astra与Sol亮相，性能跃升引发行业重新评估大模型上限。\n- **Anthropic上调发行价**：融资估值再创新高，显示资本对大模型商业化前景的强烈押注。\n## 商业财经\n- **英伟达停披新加坡销售**：营收破千亿却不再细分区域数据，市场猜测供应链与合规压力加大。\n- **神舟二十四号即将发射**：中国载人航天再进一步，空间站常态化运营进入新阶段。\n## 安全与技术\n- **Java4Shell远程代码执行漏洞**：OpenJDK处理Base64存在RCE，影响面广，企业需紧急修补。\n- **TGA2026提名名单公布**：GTA6等重磅作品入围，展现游戏产业下一波增长引擎。",
  "en": "# APEC Shenzhen summit and new AI models dominate headlines across geopolitics, tech, business, security\n## Geopolitics\n- **Xi meets Putin at APEC**：The leaders' meeting signals deeper China‑Russia strategic coordination, reshaping Asia‑Pacific dynamics.\n- **US classified comms network outage**：A top‑secret national security communications system went dark, highlighting critical infrastructure fragility.\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI releases GPT-6.2**：The Astra and Sol models push performance boundaries, prompting a industry‑wide reassessment of LLM ceilings.\n- **Anthropic raises offering price**：A higher valuation underscores investor confidence in large‑model commercialization.\n## Business & Finance\n- **Nvidia stops disclosing Singapore sales**：Despite $104B revenue, the chipmaker hides regional breakdowns, fueling speculation on supply‑chain and compliance pressures.\n- **Shenzhou 24 launch imminent**：China's crewed space program advances, moving the space station toward routine operations.\n## Security & Tech\n- **Java4Shell RCE vulnerability**：OpenJDK's Base64 handling flaw enables remote code execution, affecting a vast Java ecosystem.\n- **TGA 2026 nominations announced**：Blockbusters like GTA 6 lead the slate, signaling the next growth wave for the gaming industry."
